 "doubts": "Glade Wharf (start, reached by boat) has no matching entry, so start ref is null. Two 'Sandfly Point' entries exist; T20 is the one on Milford Sound (T21 is far south). Order of Hirere Falls and Lake Mintaro within Day 2 follows the paragraph. The text does not say where the Sutherland Falls side trip leaves the track (Day 3 is before Dumpling Hut). The Wetland Walkway leaves 10 min before Clinton Hut. Lake Ada is listed as on the way (rock cuttings alongside Arthur River and Lake Ada). The boat to Milford Sound after Sandfly Point is beyond the track's end; walkers 'may be flown' over avalanche sections only (not an exit)."
